@startuml
title DineFlow - Waiter Call
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members

autonumber
actor Customer
participant "CallService" as Calls
participant "StaffNotifier\n(staff endpoint access)" as Notifier
actor Waiter
note over Customer,Calls
P-CALL / P-STAFF proposed.
Validate customer/table context; mechanism TBD (D-07).
All staff actions require WAITER in the active restaurant membership.
The same employee may also have MANAGER; roles are not inherited.
end note
Customer -> Calls : createCall(customerId, tableId)
alt Invalid or unauthorized visit context
 Calls --> Customer : request rejected; no call created
else Valid context
 note over Calls : WaiterCall = CREATED; preserve call reference.
 Calls -> Calls : routeCall(callId)
 Calls -> Notifier : notifyStaff(callId, restaurantId)
 alt Staff endpoint receives notification
  Notifier -> Waiter : call notification
  Notifier --> Calls : DELIVERED (endpoint receipt)
  note over Calls : WaiterCall = NOTIFIED
  Calls --> Customer : notification delivered; awaiting staff response
 else Notification cannot be delivered / receipt unknown
  Notifier --> Calls : FAILED
  note over Calls : WaiterCall = DELIVERY_FAILED
  Calls --> Customer : call recorded; staff delivery failed
  opt Re-route when allowed by agreed policy (TBD)
   Calls -> Calls : routeCall(callId)
   Calls -> Notifier : notifyStaff(callId, restaurantId)
   alt Endpoint receives re-routed call
    Notifier -> Waiter : same call reference
    Notifier --> Calls : DELIVERED
    note over Calls : WaiterCall = NOTIFIED
   else Delivery still fails
    Notifier --> Calls : FAILED
    note over Calls : Retain DELIVERY_FAILED; escalation remains D-07.
   end
  end
 end
 opt Staff received the call and is authorized
  Waiter -> Calls : acknowledge(callId, staffId)
  alt Call available for acknowledgement
   note over Calls : WaiterCall = ACKNOWLEDGED; assign waiter.
   Calls --> Waiter : acknowledgement recorded
   Waiter -> Calls : resolve(callId, staffId)
   note over Calls : WaiterCall = RESOLVED
   Calls --> Waiter : resolution recorded
  else Already handled or role/context not permitted
   Calls --> Waiter : reject state change; show current status
  end
 end
end
legend bottom
FR-010, FR-014; NFR-002, NFR-006; AC-004.
Human acknowledgement is not device delivery; resolution is not acknowledgement.
Routing/acknowledgement/resolution/retry details are proposals; timings remain D-07-D-08.
endlegend
@enduml
